compress | Compress…
undo | Undo
redo | Redo
history | Operation history
filter | Filter this folder
palette | Jump to…
sort | Change sort order
sort_reverse | Reverse sort
toggle_hidden | Show / hide hidden files
toggle_hex | Hex dump of a binary file
preview_down | Scroll preview down
preview_up | Scroll preview up
bookmark | Pin / unpin this folder
switch_pane | Move between the list and the sidebar
toggle_sidebar | Show / hide the sidebar
help | Help
quit | Quit
new_file | New empty file
refresh | Refresh the folder
focus_address | Edit the address
toggle_details | Show / hide the details pane
view_details | View as details
view_icons | View as icons
toggle_view | Switch the view: Details, Icons, Columns
properties | Properties
open_with | Open with…
copy_path | Copy the path
open_terminal | Open a terminal here
context_menu | Open the context menu
new_tab | New tab
close_tab | Close tab
next_tab | Next tab
prev_tab | Previous tab
update | Update rada
quick_look | Quick Look
show_package | Show package contents
view_columns | View as columns
toggle_tags | Show / hide the Tag column
show_in_folder | Show in folder
